#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-modules-and-git.md:1126
msgid "the **working folder** - the files you edit;"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-modules-and-git.md:1127
msgid "the **staging area** - the changes you have chosen for the next commit (`git add`);"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-modules-and-git.md:1128
msgid "the **repository** - the commits, in the hidden folder `.git`."
