#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/09-modules-and-git.md:1151
msgid "See the changes: `diff`"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-modules-and-git.md:1153
msgid "What `git diff` shows is a **unified diff**: `-` for a removed line, `+` for an added one. The module `difflib` makes the same for two versions of a text:"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/09-modules-and-git.md:1172
msgid "The same for a data file: what changed between two versions of the rating scale? `n=0` shows only the changed lines, without context:"
